### Get all events
GET {{url}}/events?page=0&pageSize=20

### Search and filter
GET {{url}}/events?search=copenhagen&category=Extreme&startDate=2026-11-01

### Active categories
GET {{url}}/events/active-categories

### Get event by id
GET {{url}}/events/1

### My events as organizer/admin (attendee should not have access)
GET {{url}}/events/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create event as organizer/admin (attendee should not have access)
POST {{url}}/events
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title" : "SLS CPH",
  "description" : "Skating in Copenhagen",
  "price" : 150.00,
  "free" : false,
  "city" : "Lyngby",
  "postalCode" : "2800",
  "address" : "Hovedgaden 1",
  "startTime" : "12:30",
  "startDate" : "2027-06-12",
  "url" : "https://sls.com",
  "primaryImageUrl" : "https://sls.com/image.jpg",
  "useDefaultImage" : false,
  "category" : "Extreme"
}

### Update event as organizer/admin (attendee should not have access)
PUT {{url}}/events/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title" : "X-Games CPH",
  "description" : "Skating in Copenhagen",
  "price" : 175.00,
  "free" : false,
  "city" : "Lyngby",
  "postalCode" : "2800",
  "address" : "Hovedgaden 1",
  "startTime" : "13:00",
  "startDate" : "2027-06-12",
  "url" : "https://xgames.com",
  "primaryImageUrl" : "https://xgames.com/image.jpg",
  "useDefaultImage" : false,
  "category" : "Extreme"
}


### Delete event as organizer/admin (attendee should not have access)
DELETE {{url}}/events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Ticketmaster sync
POST {{url}}/events/ticketmaster
x-api-key: {{syncSecret}}
